abstract: >-
  Resolutive Science v0.2.0 consolidates the frozen RCMS evidence record through
  Protocol 08 under RSMS-1.0-rc.1 compatibility. The release preserves positive,
  weak, limiting, and conditional outcomes; includes independent DESI DR2
  directional replication and cross-protocol consistency analysis; and records
  a conditional mathematical provenance result for the logarithmic screening
  form. It does not claim discovery of new physics, experimental validation of
  Resolutive Physics, or statistical preference over Lambda-CDM.
